  "description": "Expression controls [EXP-01], Appendix B of the specification: FACS action units with intensity 0..1 and the additional controls. Left/right split (\"sides\": true) where the action can be unilateral: brow, lid, cheek, nose, upper lip, lip corner and nostril actions (AU1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 20, 33, 34, 35, 38, 39, 41, 42, 43, 44), AU30 (jaw to the left or right) and AU46 (wink). Eye turns AU61-64 and head turns AU51-56 are skeleton-driven, not parameters. Targets name the template's expression targets (AUnn-L / AUnn-R / AUnn, ctl.*).",
  "defaults": {
    "kind": "scalar",
    "unit": "weight",
    "min": 0.0,
